  "description": "The setup of the Rose Unibet Rockets: The Shave FFX marks the top of the Shave line-up. Pushing the limits of weight, it sets the new benchmark for all-in-one bikes in the wind tunnel. Built from high-stiffness M40X carbon and equipped with top components to maximise performance in all areas. All this makes the Shave FFX the fastest road bike we have ever built. Highlights: • M40X Carbon Layup – more than 75 g lighter2 • Aero frame design – faster than faster • Carbon cockpit – aero shape with modern dimensions • Aero carbon seat post – zero offset for maximum efficiency • 35 mm tyre clearance – more room for demanding routes • Dual-sided power meter – more data, maximum precision • UDH derailleur hanger – prepared for singlespeed shifting The Shave FFX Red AXS is equipped with SRAM's high-end electronic groupset of the same name – with 2x12 gears and a dual-sided power meter. The lightweight Rose RC55CS high-profile wheels, fitted exclusively for the Shave FFX with carbon spokes, and 28 mm Schwalbe Pro One Aero tyres ensure maximum efficiency and power savings. The sleek Selle Italia SLR carbon saddle puts the final stamp on the look and the performance. ¹ approx. 6.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for liquid racing green frame, size M, without pedals. Compared to Shave FF frameset, size M. For individual height adjustments, 20 mm spacers are fitted under the cockpit as standard. The illustrations show the Shave without spacers with a shortened steerer tube.",
